  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Natural Resources Develop Project (NRDP) - NRDP-Monitoring</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Naturresursf&#xf6;rvaltning</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet avser etablera och underh&#xe5;lla uth&#xe5;llig resursf&#xf6;rvaltning i h&#xf6;gl&#xe4;nt och erosionsk&#xe4;nslig terr&#xe4;ng, som leder till &#xf6;kad  produktivitet och inkomster genom reducerad degradering av jordar, f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrad vattenf&#xf6;rvaltning, bevarande av biologisk m&#xe5;ngfald och st&#xe4;rkt offentlig f&#xf6;rvaltning av dessa resureser.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to establish or maintain sustainable community-based natural resource management in upland, mountainous erosion-prone lands, leading to enhanced productivity and incomes derived from sustainable resource management, reduced soil degradation, improved water management, conservation of biodiversity and strengthened public sector management of these resources.</narrative>
  </description>
